-- Regexp with Quoted escaping: an unquoted number for DateTime64 is seconds
2023-12-23 20:37:33.000
2023-12-23 20:37:33.035
-- Regexp with Quoted escaping: the same for DateTime, a fractional number is truncated
2023-12-23 20:37:33
2023-12-23 20:37:33
-- Regexp compatibility: a bare integer for DateTime64 is the raw scaled value (ticks)
2023-12-23 20:37:33.035
-- Regexp compatibility: a fractional number is rejected, not truncated to its integer prefix
-- Quoted strings are unaffected by the setting
2023-12-23 20:37:33.035
2023-12-23 20:37:33.035
